  "releaseNotes": "v2.3.0 - 2026-04-25\n      Added:\n      - CatchExceptionAsync(Func<Task>) - async exception catcher with fatal exception filtering\n      - DoesNotThrowAsync(Func<Task>, Func<string, ValueTask>) - async action overload\n      Changed:\n      - CatchException(Action) - refactored as sync wrapper (backward compatible)\n      - DoesNotThrow(Action, Action<string>) - refactored as sync wrapper (backward compatible)\n      - Async assertion methods visibility: protected → public (non-breaking)\n      Improved:\n      - Completed async-first architecture from v2.2.0\n      - Eliminated #pragma warning disable CA2012\n      - Added comprehensive documentation for IsNotFatal and all new/changed methods\n      - Consistent fatal exception handling across all sync/async paths\n      Dependencies:\n      - Portamical.Core 2.2.0 (unchanged)\n      Breaking Changes:\n      - None - fully backward compatible with 2.2.x",
